  },
  {
   "id": 166,
   "en": "Damn, that was careless of me!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 167,
   "en": "Protect the Earth, all of you!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 168,
   "en": "I am the king of the universe... King Vegaaa!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 169,
   "en": "Kyaaah! Kojiii!!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 170,
   "en": "And it had nearly succeeded...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 171,
   "en": "Oh no... Escape, escape!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 172,
   "en": "The power of Getter... Dammit!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 173,
   "en": "Oh, well. The rest is up to you guys.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 174,
   "en": "Well, I'll be. Whoa!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 175,
   "en": "E-Emperor Burai!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 176,
   "en": "Don't think you've won!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 177,
   "en": "Dammiiit! You'll pay for this!!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 178,
   "en": "Gyaaaah!!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 179,
   "en": "Mia, I'll never let you go, never...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 180,
   "en": "...Now the real battle begins...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 181,
   "en": "I can still fiiight! Let me fiiight!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 182,
   "en": "Lord Garuda...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 183,
   "en": "I don't wanna die yeeet!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 184,
   "en": "Gwaaaagh! Brotheeer!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 185,
   "en": "L-Lord Baraooo!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 186,
   "en": "Tch! What a disgrace!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 187,
   "en": "With the Demon Century's revival right before my eyes...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 188,
   "en": "Not yet! Raideen! Whoa!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 189,
   "en": "Grr! How... how could this be...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 190,
   "en": "Bailing out! Requesting recovery...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 191,
   "en": "Bailing out!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 192,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 193,
   "en": "Bailing ou...!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 194,
   "en": "Bailing ou...!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 195,
   "en": "...Yes, it's a dream... just a really, really bad dream!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 196,
   "en": "...Oh, well.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 197,
   "en": "...Oh, well.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 198,
   "en": "So... this is the end...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 199,
   "en": "Tobikage... you came! Let's combine!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 200,
   "en": "Tobikage...! All right, let's go!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 201,
   "en": "Now we've got the upper hand! Let's go!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
