  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "Hold it right there!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "Heh heh heh... Hahahahahaha!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "Yes... that is the teaching of Tenku Chushin Ken!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "However dark the night, it always comes to an end.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "The darkness melts away, and morning fills the world...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "People call it dawn...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "The spirit of justice that defies evil's violence and fights fear...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "People call it courage...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "When evil fills the land, a loving heart and a burning soul will cut it down...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "People call it truth...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Wah! That voice!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Kenrou, grant me power!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Nngh! You there, what is your name?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Hm!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "What? Where's that coming from!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Tearing through darkness and evil, charging onward toward justice...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "People call it fighting spirit...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "...The Earth Sphere is full of enemies, inside and out... but allies too.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "No boson reaction. ...Even Omoikane can't pinpoint where it came from.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Ruri-Ruri, asking about that is just tactless.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "...I'm not convinced, though.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Wow, long time no see, huh?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Aw, crap! Of all the pests...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "I'll ask anyway, just for form's sake! Who the heck are ya!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "So you're on the Earthlings' side!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "No ice, however cold, can ever defeat a burning heart.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "A fire that no storm can put out...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "People call it passion...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "After the storm of cruelty passes, the sky of justice spreads far and wide...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "People call it daybreak...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "The wind of the plains knows not where it was born.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "But the wind is bound by no one, and ruled by no one...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "People call it freedom...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Wha!? N-No way...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Those with wicked hearts cannot look straight at the light of truth.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "A light that pierces through lies...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "People call it sincerity...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "...Who goes there!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Huh!? No way... Londo Bell!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "What!? Impossible, our jamming was perfect! And... it's too soon...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "You fools, victory will never come to you.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "A heart that will not yield to evil, even in the face of death.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "In time, that heart calls forth the wind of victory...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "People call it the triumphant wind...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "What!? Where are you!? You dare speak so to an officer of the Vega...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "...Star Federation, Captain of King Vega's Royal Guard, Gorman!?",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Mocking me like this... Who are you!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Hm!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Wow! Could it be? Could it really be?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Though a lawless storm may rage, if you have a heart that will not break,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "one day the storm will fall calm, and peace will return.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Misfortune always passes...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "People call it the wheel of fortune...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "What!? You... who are you!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Don't think power and greed can lead hearts astray forever.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Hands clasped firmly together cannot be torn apart by violence...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "People call it a bond...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Fools who know nothing of the emptiness of war...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "War is permitted only to save those we love.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "One who has the courage to cast aside one's own life for that victory...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "People call such a one a hero...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "A noble heart that loves friends, honors parents, and gives to others...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "People call it friendship...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Hm!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Joe!? Just now, I thought I heard Joe's voice...!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "No!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "That voice... I see, you've come!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "To bend innocent children's hearts to serve one's own greed is sad...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "People call it ego...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "...!!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "No way!? Now of all times!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "It's you...! Rom Stol! It's you, isn't it!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "There are two kinds of people in this world...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "those who love peace and try to help one another,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "and those who love war and try to kill one another.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "But only those who stay true to love will find a wonderful future...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "People call it happiness...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Anger and sorrow breed strife and ruin; joy brings peace and creation...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Peace prevails over strife, and creation over destruction...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "People call it the victory of love...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "When wicked stars fill the heavens, a great shooting star appears,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "and before its true light, the wicked stars lose their glow and fall...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "People call it judgment...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Maggots feeding on bloodstained wealth and power... see yourselves!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "A light that shows the righteous path...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "People call it a mirror...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "What did you say!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "...So you've come...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "The waterfall's flow washes all things clean.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Even you who have lived for evil, if you cleanse yourselves in its flow,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "a wonderful future may await you...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "People call it redemption...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Dang, I wasted too much time...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "You... who are you!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Devils who deceive those who believe in God, painting truth over with lies...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Even if God never appears, someday one with a true heart will surely",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "judge evil in God's stead...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "People call it divine punishment...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "What...?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "...!!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "That voice!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Where is it? There's no one on the bridge... Where's it coming from!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Even beasts who live by the law of the jungle take no joy in killing...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Only those who have fallen into evil do that.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "But God will never forgive your wicked hearts.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "The great wrath of heaven...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "People call it thunder...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Spouting nonsense on and on...! You've got guts, defying the Bunker!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Who the hell are you!?",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Even the smallest flower, once it blooms on the earth,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "can pierce through rock with its roots.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "The great power born of nature...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "People call it mystery...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Though danger may lie ahead, if there is something in one's heart to protect,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "one will guard it with body and soul, even at the cost of one's life...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "People call it manhood...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "You who are controlled by a dictator... do you still not understand!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "People call it a puppet...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Battle begets battle, and those who strike down will be struck down...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "People call it the cycle of rebirth...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "What!? Where are you!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Hm!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Those who try to stop a great river's flow by force",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "will in time realize their own folly.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "The tide of justice can no longer be stopped...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "People call it the raging torrent...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Where are you! You coward,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "who do you think you are, talking that way to Mashymre Cello!?",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "You're a real pain! Just what are you!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Even that which was destroyed and crumbled in a storm of violence...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "as long as a heartbeat of life remains, it will surely rise again...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "People call it resurrection...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "What!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "Each grain of sand that slips through your hand was once a boulder.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "It was crushed by the power of the unseen wind.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "However mighty evil may be... I shall become the unseen wind and strike it!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "People call it erosion...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "That's right, in this battle... we're not the only ones fighting...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Londo Bell reinforcements!? Don't give me that crap! Who are you!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "...!!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "Whether in frozen glaciers or in flames that scorch the body,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "one never goes back on a vow sworn in one's heart...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "That which must be protected, even under the assault of force...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "People call it dignity...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "What!? How dare you speak so to King Vega! Who are you!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "...!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "Hear the voice of the forest, hear the voice of the wind!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "They are laughing at your wicked hearts...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "People call it the spirits of the wild...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "Whaaat! Where, where!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Confirmed. ...This is absurd. Someone is standing on top of the field.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "S-Someone!? You're kidding, right, Ruri?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "...If I were kidding, I'd say something funnier.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "Who are you? Name yourself!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "Nngh!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "Wow! Could it be, could it really, really be?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "Hahahaha! And who might \"them\" be, Devil Saturn 6?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "...Crap...! Speak of the devil!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "That laugh... But, but, that was back on Mars...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "Cross-checking... It appears to be the same person.",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "W-We're... in outer space, right...?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "However vast an evil may exist,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "among these stars it is no more than a speck of dust...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "That which holds the eternal flow of time and boundless expanse...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "People call it the universe...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "This presence... no ordinary foe! Grr! Your name, tell me your name!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "Those drunk on their own power will surely fall to a greater one,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "and come to regret their own folly...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "People call it inevitable doom...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "Whaddya say!? Who d'ya think you're talkin' to!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "What!? Another one!? Where are you!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "Huh, what's that...? Captain Bright! Up there!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "Huh? No way!? Hey, Captain! That's a bad spot!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "Up there!? What do you mean, Lieutenant Uraki? Bad how!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "Those blind to a flower's beauty can't know the worth of treasure...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "True treasure is the richness of heart that lies within one's breast...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "People call it abundance...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "S-Someone's... on top of the Ra Cailum's... bridge!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "What...!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "Quit yer yappin'! Who are ya!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 410,
   "en": "Battle breeds betrayal and hatred...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 411,
   "en": "But trust brings peace of mind and true friends.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 412,
   "en": "Trust without a single shadow of doubt...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 413,
   "en": "People call it a bond...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 414,
   "en": "Migrating birds rest their wings on twigs adrift in the sea.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 415,
   "en": "Then they await the right wind, follow their hearts, and fly toward justice...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 416,
   "en": "People call it soaring...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 417,
   "en": "Nn... gwuuh!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 418,
   "en": "...!!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 419,
   "en": "That voice!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 420,
   "en": "Heh, you sure took your time...",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 421,
   "en": "Every person holds limitless power, enough to move the universe.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 422,
   "en": "But some will try to use that power for destruction and slaughter...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 423,
   "en": "Creation or destruction: it is the final choice left in human hands.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 424,
   "en": "A heart that will not let the light, the source of all life, go out...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 425,
   "en": "People call it love...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 426,
   "en": "Who are you!? You...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 427,
   "en": "What!? A sudden reading on radar!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 428,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 429,
   "en": "Realizing one's mistakes, and reflecting upon them,",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 430,
   "en": "becomes the power to open new horizons.",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 431,
   "en": "But never forget the weight of what is lost along the way...",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 432,
   "en": "People call it admonition...!",
   "kind": "page",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 433,
   "en": "Y-You're... could it be!?",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 434,
   "en": "I have no name to give you people!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 435,
   "en": "I have no name to give you scum!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 436,
   "en": "I have no name to give the likes of you!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 437,
   "en": "Son of Kirai Stol, chief of the Kronos clan... Rom Stol!",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "keep": false
  }
 ]
}